WEBVTT

00:18:58.574 --> 00:19:00.683
There is plenty of beautiful
things going on.

00:19:00.707 --> 00:19:03.916
There are angels
around America doing great things

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:06.837
in schools -- farm-to-school set-ups,

00:19:06.861 --> 00:19:09.472
garden set-ups, education --

00:19:09.496 --> 00:19:11.593
there are amazing people
doing this already.

00:19:11.617 --> 00:19:13.546
The problem is they all want to roll out

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.705
what they're doing to the next school,

00:19:15.729 --> 00:19:17.077
but there's no cash.

00:19:17.997 --> 00:19:21.697
We need to recognize the experts
and the angels quickly,

00:19:21.721 --> 00:19:24.916
identify them, and allow them
to easily find the resource

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.180
to keep rolling out
what they're already doing,

00:19:27.204 --> 00:19:28.204
and doing well.

00:19:28.788 --> 00:19:31.060
Businesses of America need to support